{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "verses-of-equilibrium",
  "name": "Verses of Equilibrium",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Verses_of_Equilibrium",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-06T09:38:51.375Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Of all the elements in the land, Geo alone stands fast,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Built on a bedrock of proud tradition, which doth make it last."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For just is the law of Rex Lapis, and ineffable His wisdom —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The cornerstones of justice, which prevails throughout His kingdom."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Slayer of foul demons, no evil would He leave unquenched."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6666a339bc4cbb10"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He sought celestial order, to stay the tide of turbulence."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Adepti rallied round Him, yaksha guardians charged ahead,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Frightened by the courageous people the demons fled."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Lord then fashioned mighty rocks, which into the earth He cast:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sea monster subdued, peace returned at last!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fe9bef60a2af55d0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though demons lay defeated, their souls did plot revenge."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Down into the watery abyss the demonic souls did descend."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hatred fueled their rage. Rage, in turn, did blunt their mind,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Their folly sullied the seas, whence the demons multiplied:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A demonic infestation thus engendered by the fallen souls."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ce22348da0e3b635"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Five yaksha guardians His Majesty task'd with evil to defeat,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To rid the world of poisonous rage with which the demons seethed."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mountains shook as yaksha wrath with golden splendor burned,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But though they purged the evil, alas! One alone returned:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Alatus, by whose talons foes were quashed and peace procured."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-873ea8fbf85d8441"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A peace that harked to days gone by was the peace that now endured."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Peace restored, adepti back to Jueyun Karst ascended."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Duty fulfilled, yakshas off to unknown corners departed."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May this lowly offering departed souls appease."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And may these words by fire's light His Majesty's heart please."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dd79c827b24a6f1b"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
